WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Hello, I am Roujia who is here for an interview today.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,800
Interview? I don’t have any weird power on my body.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,560
Sorry, we are here

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,550
I understand, please don't worry

5
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:16,050
It turned out to be a real human being, but there was something wrong with the timing of entering the dungeon.

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,050
The copy is not open, Weird Ben can touch it

7
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:21,480
But the BOSS didn’t give the order, something is wrong with this player

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,980
Madam, you're early

9
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,780
The entry time for interns is 10 o'clock

10
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,380
Could you please go and wait on the sofa over there?

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,580
Intern? I'm here for an interview

12
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,780
Someone asked me to come at 9 o'clock. Please confirm again.

13
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,580
The people who are here for the interview today are all interns, there is nothing wrong with that.

14
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:38,080
There may be a problem with internal communication within the company

15
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,680
Forget it, wait a minute

16
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:46,180
Why don't you let me get rid of this human being who invaded outside the specified time?

17
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:49,180
A human being who cannot be controlled by the system is interesting, isn't it?
